{"site":"simplyrecipes.com","doc":"docs/HISTORY/simplyrecipes.com.md","events":[{"k":"Founding","y":"2003","t":"Founded: 2003","s":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7521021"},{"k":"Founding","t":"Founders (public figures only): unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Founding","y":"2002","t":"First archived copy: 2002-08-02","s":"https://web.archive.org/web/20020802014441/http://www.simplyrecipes.com:80/"},{"k":"Ownership","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2003","t":"2003: \"Bauer began writing the blog in 2003 to record her family recipes.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes"},{"k":"Ownership changes, pivots and shutdowns","y":"2016","t":"2016: \"Simply Recipes was acquired by Fexy Media in 2016, and later by Dotdash in 2020\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes"},{"k":"Peak traffic","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Notable features","y":"","t":"\"Bauer writes about recipes for popular dishes such as meatloaf and apple pie, as well as how-to articles on subjects such as how to cook the perfect boiled egg or how to best caramelize an onion.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Content"},{"k":"Notable features","y":"","t":"\"The blog often features guest bloggers.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Content"},{"k":"Notable features","y":"","t":"\"Each recipe is attached with a photo of the final product, along with several photos that portray each major step in the recipe.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Content"},{"k":"Controversies","y":"2007","t":"\"By January 2007, Simply Recipes was receiving over one million visits per month and had over 500 recipes.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Reception"},{"k":"Controversies","y":"2006","t":"\"The Well Fed Network, a compilation of food blogs, awarded Simply Recipes the award for best blog overall of 2006.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Reception"},{"k":"Controversies","y":"2010","t":"\"In 2010, Forbes magazine listed Bauer among \"Eight Of The Very Best Food Bloggers.\" Bauer's blog has been described as taking a \"relaxed approach\" to food.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Reception"},{"k":"Controversies","y":"","t":"\"Maggie Wrobel of The Globe and Mail appreciated the website's method of organizing recipes in categories, making it easier to find recipes that she was interested in.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simply_Recipes#Reception"},{"k":"Press","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1}],"snaps":[["2002","https://web.archive.org/web/20020802014441/http://www.simplyrecipes.com:80/"],["2003","https://web.archive.org/web/20030402122624/http://www.simplyrecipes.com:80/"],["2004","https://web.archive.org/web/20040327123513/http://www.simplyrecipes.com:80/"],["2005","https://web.archive.org/web/20050207025110/http://simplyrecipes.com:80/"],["2009","https://web.archive.org/web/20090518183132/http://simplyrecipes.com/"],["2010","https://web.archive.org/web/20100102003306/http://simplyrecipes.com/"],["2011","https://web.archive.org/web/20110111002846/http://simplyrecipes.com/"],["2012","https://web.archive.org/web/20120103092100/http://simplyrecipes.com/"],["2013","https://web.archive.org/web/20130101114946/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2014","https://web.archive.org/web/20140101162254/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2015","https://web.archive.org/web/20150102111955/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2016","https://web.archive.org/web/20160101002354/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2017","https://web.archive.org/web/20170105051928/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2018","https://web.archive.org/web/20180103233612/http://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2019","https://web.archive.org/web/20190102175241/https://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2020","https://web.archive.org/web/20200102024416/https://www.simplyrecipes.com/"],["2021","https://web.archive.org/web/20210101125806/https:/